    "title": "#2 Wisdom from the Streets: Reflections on The Tao of Wu",
    "description": "Blending elements of Eastern philosophy, martial arts, and hip-hop culture, RZA offers a guide to navigating life’s challenges with wisdom, discipline, and authenticity.",
    "url": "https://mindlines.substack.com/p/2-wisdom-from-the-streets-reflections",
